  data: {
    LLM: "1. Must follow suit if possible.\n2. Highest Matador wins any trick, followed by other trumps, then high cards of led suit.\n3. **Puesta**: If the Hombre doesn't win more tricks than one opponent, they 'lose' and must pay the pot.",
    Player: "1. Must follow suit if possible.\n2. Highest Matador wins any trick, followed by other trumps, then high cards of led suit.\n3. **Puesta**: If the Hombre doesn't win more tricks than one opponent, they 'lose' and must pay the pot.",
